<%# Plain text: values are output raw, since HTML escaping would show up literally. -%>
<% content_for :footer, raw(["You're receiving this because more than #{AlertDelivery::HOURLY_CAP} alerts were due for you within an hour.", ("Mute #{@projects.first.name} alerts: #{@mute_url}" if @mute_url), "Notification settings: #{notifications_url}"].compact.join("\n")) -%>
And <%= pluralize(delimited(@total), "more alert") %>

To keep your inbox usable, Good Sorcery sends at most <%= AlertDelivery::HOURLY_CAP %> alert emails an hour. These alerts were due after that and weren't sent one by one:

<% @projects.each do |project| -%>
<%= raw project.name %>: <%= alert_summary_line(@counts.fetch(project.id.to_s)) %>
<% end -%>

<%= @open_url %>
